<a href="https://vogelwijk.example.org/en/articles/buurtbatterij" style="color:#1b1b1f;text-decoration:underline;">View this e-mail in your browser</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:0 8px 24px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1b1b1f;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;">
<tr><td style="padding:16px 24px;background-color:#2d6cb5;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;"><a href="https://vogelwijk.example.org" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Vogelwijk Energie</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:28px 24px 20px;"><h1 style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;">A battery for the Vogelwijk</h1><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;">From spring, a shared battery stores the solar power of forty roofs.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px;"><img src="https://vogelwijk.example.org/media/<image>/w1.webp" alt="Solar panels on a row of roofs" width="1" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:1px;height:auto;border:0;"><p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;">The Malieveld on Saturday · Photo: Noor Bakker</p></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:20px 24px;font-size:14px;background-color:#f3f3f0;color:#1b1b1f;">You receive this e-mail from Vogelwijk Energie. <a href="https://vogelwijk.example.org" style="color:#1f4f8f;text-decoration:underline;color:#1b1b1f;">vogelwijk.example.org</a></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>
"
